  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-17T22:12:31.707Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\nIn the CTOVRC (Clone Troopers of VRChat) we experienced an issue of people turning invisible upon death (this includes avatar and nameplate).\nWe are using the SDK2 combat system with death timers > 0.\nThis issue was reported for 6-point tracking (fullbody), 3-point tracking (regular VR) and even desktop users at different rates. The more tracking points, the more likely it is for this issue to occur.\nThe only way to fix this is to hide and show the users avatar. Although this is not a good solution, since you have to find the users bubble first and doing so is unacceptable in the middle of combat.\nI am very willing to help in any way and provide footage of said issue if needed.",
